//   freeFileWinBuf 0x0049d460 (0x0049d3b2); readSectionGlobal 0x00487e70 ("jackal" 0x004e4680, "FILEWIN" 0x004e4a08)
//   non-zero returns 6 (0x0049d3cb); readLineGlobal 0x00487e90 NULL returns 1 (0x0049d3de). A non-NULL 0x00840820 is freed
//   and cleared (0x0049d3ef-0x0049d3fa); malloc(strlen(line) + 1) (0x0049d410) goes to 0x00840820, NULL returning 4
//   (0x0049d41f); the line is copied into it (0x0049d429-0x0049d455). eax is 0 at the end (the `xor eax, eax` of the
